# Raw 3D model sources and their texture sources are not published here:
# several models come from third-party/purchased asset packs whose licenses forbid
# redistributing source files. Keep them local; Workbench builds from the local copies.
*.fbx
*.FBX
*.blend
*.blend1
*.psd
**/Assets/**/*.png
**/Assets/**/*.tif
**/Assets/**/*.tiff
**/Assets/**/*.tga
